# Pairs with BulkHintBound. The old leaf completes an admitted commit without
# storing its row, so the narrow hands back nothing for it.
MODULE: BulkHintBoundCommitStoreLost
TARGET: BulkHintBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an admitted commit is never stored on the old leaf
PERTURBS: CommitStore

--- FIND
    /\ rowsO' = rowsO \cup {CHOOSE o \in Offs : author[o] = "c"}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the commit's row is not stored.
    /\ rowsO' = rowsO
--- END
